$L2",null,{"href":"/hi/saints","className":"hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors","children":"संत"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"→"}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/80 font-medium truncate","children":"श्री बिहारिन देव, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (150)"}]]}],["$","$L3",null,{"children":["$","$L4",null,{"initialSaint":{"name":"श्री बिहारिन देव, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (150)","hinglishName":"shri biharin dev, shri biharin dev ju ki vani, siddhant ki sakhi (150)","slug":"shri-biharin-dev-shri-biharin-dev-ju-ki-vani-siddhant-ki-sakhi-150","biography":"","metadata":null,"imageUrl":null,"verses":[{"id":"local-581","title":"ऐसी स्वामिनी साहिबिनी","category":"Shloka","sanskrit_text":"ऐसी स्वामिनी साहिबिनी, रसिक अनन्य उदार।श्री बिहारिनिदासि प्रसन्न ह्वै, दियो अहार विहार॥","hindi_text":"श्री बिहारिन देव के शब्दों में स्वामिनी श्री राधारानी अत्यन्त उदार हैं एवं रसिक अनन्य की नित्य सहायता करने वाली हैं। श्री बिहारिन देव जी कहते हैं कि मुझ पर तो मानो प्रिया प्रसन्न हो गयी हैं और अपना नित्य विहार रस दे दिया।","english_text":null,"english_translation":"Śrī Bihārīn Dev says: Śrī Rādhā is such a generous and causeless merciful Swāminī (the one who always protects the Rāsiks) that after being pleased from me, She has provided her topmost bliss of Nitya Vihāra to me!\nRāsiks are also called “Rāsik Ananya” since they are exclusive devotees of Śrī Rādhā!","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a694d8d82274812fecf966c/aisi-swamini-sahibini-rasik-anany-udaar-shri-biharinidasi-prasann-hvai-diyo-ahar-vihar-shri-biharin-dev-rasopasna-tilak","author":"श्री बिहारिन देव, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (150)","status":"published","content_text":"ऐसी स्वामिनी साहिबिनी, रसिक अनन्य उदार।\nश्री बिहारिनिदासि प्रसन्न ह्वै, दियो अहार विहार॥\n- श्री बिहारिन देव, श्री बिहारिन देव जू की वाणी, सिद्धान्त की साखी (150)\nश्री बिहारिन देव के शब्दों में स्वामिनी श्री राधारानी अत्यन्त उदार हैं एवं रसिक अनन्य की नित्य सहायता करने वाली हैं। श्री बिहारिन देव जी कहते हैं कि मुझ पर तो मानो प्रिया प्रसन्न हो गयी हैं और अपना नित्य विहार रस दे दिया।","tags":["Braj Rasik","Mass Import"],"image_urls":[],"video_urls":[],"media_links":[],"source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5a694d8d82274812fecf966c/aisi-swamini-sahibini-rasik-anany-udaar-shri-biharinidasi-prasann-hvai-diyo-ahar-vihar-shri-biharin-dev-rasopasna-tilak","slug":"aisi-svamini-sahibini"}],"books":[],"rawItem":null}}]}]],null],null],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children","$6","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[null,["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children","saints","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]],null]},[[null,["$","div",null,{"lang":"hi","children":["$","$L5",null,{"parallelRouterKey":"children","segmentPath":["children","hi","children"],"error":"$undefined","errorStyles":"$undefined","errorScripts":"$undefined","template":["$","$L7",null,{}],"templateStyles":"$undefined","templateScripts":"$undefined","notFound":"$undefined","notFoundStyles":"$undefined"}]}]],null],null]},[[[["$","link","0",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/cbf73327883ccb7f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","1",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/fe995a1e4635138b.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}],["$","link","2",{"rel":"stylesheet","href":"/_next/static/css/848f1edf91a8622f.css","precedence":"next","crossOrigin":"$undefined"}]],["$","html",null,